            "text_classes": "",
            "remove_text_wrapper": false,
            "heading": "<span class=\"uppercase font-medium tracking-wider text-sm text-shell-800 mb-1\">Clean Ingredients</span>\n<h2 class=\"font-serif text-3xl mb-2\">The Secret to Anti-Aging Is Seaweed</h2>\n<p class=\"font-book\">Undaria seaweed is hand-harvested from the coastal waters of the northwest Pacific and naturally rich in antioxidant vitamins A, C and E. Soaked in a blend of botanical oils, it visibly improves elasticity &amp; firms like no other for softer, smoother, more youthful-looking skin.</p>",
            "heading_classes": "mb-4",
            "paragraph": "<div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-center\">\n        <div class=\"ingredient-photo-card\">\n          <img src=\"https://osea.imgix.net/files/ki-undaria.jpg?v=1746051037&amp;auto=format,compress&amp;w=192\" alt=\"Undaria Seaweed\" class=\"w-32 h-32 rounded-full mx-auto mb-2\">\n          <strong class=\"ing-title\">Undaria Seaweed</strong>\n          <p class=\"text-sm leading-tight\">Hand-harvested, rich in amino acids, antioxidants and vitamins to help replenish the skin's moisture barrier.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ingredient-photo-card\">\n          <img src=\"https://osea.imgix.net/files/ki-clear_oil_0da93786-8d9b-461e-a827-b517c0cd2ac8.jpg?v=1759468514&amp;auto=format,compress&amp;w=192\" alt=\"Botanical Oil Blend\" class=\"w-32 h-32 rounded-full mx-auto mb-2\">\n          <strong class=\"ing-title\">Botanical Oil Blend</strong>\n          <p class=\"text-sm leading-tight\">A blend of passion fruit, acai, babassu and rice bran oils for deep moisture to replenish dry skin.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ingredient-photo-card\">\n          <img src=\"https://osea.imgix.net/files/ki-white_lupin.jpg?v=1759468049&amp;auto=format,compress&amp;w=192\" alt=\"White Lupin\" class=\"w-32 h-32 rounded-full mx-auto mb-2\">\n          <strong class=\"ing-title\">White Lupin</strong>\n          <p class=\"text-sm leading-tight\">Helps visibly firm and improve skin elasticity for more youthful-looking skin.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n<modal-opener class=\"no-js-hidden block text-center\" data-modal=\"#IngredientsPopup\">\n        <button class=\"button button-secondary button-sm w-full\" type=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\">Full ingredients list</button>\n      </modal-opener>\n<modal-dialog id=\"IngredientsPopup\">\n  <div role=\"dialog\" aria-label=\"Full ingredients list\" aria-modal=\"true\" class=\"!pr-4\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n    <button id=\"ModalClose-IngredientsPopup\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Close\">×</button>\n    <div class=\"w-full max-h-96 overflow-auto pr-4\">\n\n          <h2 class=\"font-serif text-3xl tracking-tight mb-2\">Ingredients</h2>\n          <p>Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Undaria Pinnatifida Powder, Citrus Paradisi (Grapefruit) Peel Oil, Tocopherol, Lupinus Albus Seed Extract, Passiflora Edulis Seed Oil, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Bran Oil, Euterpe Oleracea Fruit Oil, Orbignya Oleifera Seed Oil, Sesamum Indicum (Sesame) Seed Oil, Linum Usitatissimum (Linseed) Seed Oil, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Bran Extract, Rosmarinus Officinalis (Rosemary) Leaf Extract, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Extract, Citrus Latifolia Peel Oil, Cupressus Sempervirens Branch/Leaf Oil, Fragrance/Parfum*</p>\n<br><p>*Natural Fragrance is a blend of aromatic compounds and/or essential oil(s) extracted from different parts of plants including flowers and fruits. These can be used to help get the sophisticated fragrances that make OSEA products smell wonderful.</p>\n          <cite class=\"text-sm mt-4 leading-tight block\">From time to time, ingredients may be updated. Please check the product packaging for the latest ingredient list.</cite>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</modal-dialog>",
